## Configuration

Configuration lives in `config/`:
- `config.exs` - Shared config
- `dev.exs` - Development
- `test.exs` - Test environment
- `prod.exs` - Production

- `runtime.exs` - Secrets and anything read from the environment at boot (`System.fetch_env!/1`)

**Never hardcode configuration values.**
- Values read inside a module body (module attributes, compile-time branches) → `Application.compile_env(:your_app, :key)`
- Values read at runtime inside functions → `Application.get_env(:your_app, :key)` / `Application.fetch_env!/2`
- Secrets and per-environment values (database URL, API keys, hosts) → `config/runtime.exs`, never `prod.exs`

